<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Sustainable Cities</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-image: url('https://example.com/background-image.jpg');
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            animation: backgroundAnimate 30s linear infinite;
        }

        @keyframes backgroundAnimate {
            0% {
                background-position: 0% 50%;
            }
            100% {
                background-position: 100% 50%;
            }
        }

        header,
        footer {
            background: linear-gradient(to right, #003049, #005a9c);
        }

        a {
            color: #ffffff;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        a:hover {
            color: #cccccc;
        }

        header {
            background-color: #005a9c;
            color: white;
            padding: 1rem;
            position: relative;
        }

        header::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0, 89, 156, 0.8), rgba(0, 89, 156, 0));
            z-index: -1;
        }

        main {
            padding: 2rem;
            margin: 0 auto;
            max-width: 800px;
            animation: fadeIn 2s ease-in;
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
            }
        }

        h1, h2 {
            color: #005a9c;
            animation: slideInLeft 1s ease-in-out;
        }

        @keyframes slideInLeft {
            from {
                transform: translateX(-100%);
                opacity: 0;
            }
            to {
                transform: translateX(0);
                opacity: 1;
            }
        }

        footer {
            background-color: #005a9c;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 1rem;
            margin-top: 1.5rem;
            animation: slideInUp 1s ease-in-out;
        }

        @keyframes slideInUp {
            from {
                transform: translateY(100%);
                opacity: 0;
            }
            to {
                transform: translateY(0);
                opacity: 1;
            }
        }

        @media screen and (max-width: 600px) {
            main {
                width: 100%;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>Sustainable Cities</h1>
    </header>
    <main>
        <h2>Welcome to our website!</h2>
        <p>Here, you'll find information about sustainable cities, their benefits, and how we can contribute to their development.</p>
        <h2>What are sustainable cities?</h2>
        <p>Sustainable cities are urban areas that create and maintain the health, safety, and prosperity of their inhabitants, while also protecting the environment. Learn more about sustainable cities in our <a href="#">guide</a>.</p>
    </main>
    <footer>
        &copy; 2023 Sustainable Cities. All rights reserved.
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
